  "prompt": "一段用于室内loft二层边缘的模块化木质安全栏杆，高约1.3米。采用加粗端柱、密集竖杆和厚实连续扶手，能够首尾无缝拼接。木纹、构件比例、扶手截面、立柱和细节必须与配套直跑式楼梯完全一致。整体结构坚固精致，适合炼金工坊。所有普通材质仅使用目标色卡颜色：主木色#52362E，较亮木纹和边缘#714D48，不使用任何色卡外颜色。\nCoordinate contract: local Y+ is up, local Z+ is the front, entrance, or forward direction, and local X+ is right. Put doors, facades, openings, windshields, noses, seats, and other recognizable front details toward local Z+. For a modular repeated element, explicitly choose the long axis: side-by-side modules span local X with depth/front on local Z; traversal modules span local Z. Keep the model centered at its origin.\nCanonical dimensions contract: width=5.6, height=1.3, depth=0.18 world units. Keep the generated mesh within this centered bounding size.",
